Create Room: 
Wanderers can freely create Training Terrace rooms. Upon success, you become the Host, with rights to manage members and arrange matches. The Host can transfer status to others. If the Host leaves, status automatically transfers to the member with the highest Popularity. 

Format: 
The Host can set the room's challenge mode to Free Mode or Admin Mode. 
In Free Mode, players in the room can freely select members or teams to initiate Open or Directed Challenges; 
In Admin Mode, players or captains sign up, and the Host decides the match-ups; 
Victory conditions: Best of 1, Best of 3, and Best of 5; 
Training Terrace currently supports 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and 5v5 team battles. 

Popularity and Room Heat: 
Receiving gifts in the room increases personal Popularity. The more players, battles, and gifts, the higher the Room Heat. Room Heat and member Popularity reset daily at 5:00 AM.
